# NOTE: public/genz-whatsapp.apk is deliberately TRACKED, NOT ignored.
# The site-only distribution model serves /genz-whatsapp.apk from the deployed
# dist/, which is built from the git checkout — so the APK must be committed
# with every release (see docs/APK_RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md). Ignoring it made the
# production download serve the SPA fallback (index.html) instead of the APK.
